00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:13.920
Now, for an authenticated
user, the policy is to be able

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:22.530
to read/write the recipe
if it's not private --

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.550
not write but at least read
it if it's not private,

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:32.410
or if it's private but you
are the one that created it.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:37.860
